<title>USA: CBOE to list CIENA Corp options on May 14.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list CIENA Corp options on May 14.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange said it would list options on CIENA Corp shares on May 14.</p>
<p>The options will have initial strike prices of 25, 30 and 35, with expirations in June, July, October and January, CBOE said.</p>
<p>Option Funding Group has been named the designated primary market maker, the exchange added.</p>
<p>Chicago Derivatives Desk ((312-408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
